{
  "about": "E2.3.S1: the adapted copy of dew_flow_mcp tests/Mcp.Tests/Leftovers (D1), at one commit. Per file: upstream path, target path, upstream git blob SHA, ordered exact-replace operations with their match counts and, beyond the namespace line, a reason. The check undoes them in reverse on the raw bytes and compares the git blob SHA. Limits copied with the template: F29 - on Windows two creds test executables started at once can each sweep the same root; then one can report a removal it did not do, or restore a folder without its claim. Run them one at a time. F31 - what a run in an elevated Windows process leaves is owned by BUILTIN\\Administrators: no sweep removes it and the audit's claim scan does not see it; it waits for a person.",
